{
  "mn13:0.1": "Majjhima Nikāya 13 ",
  "mn13:0.2": "Mahādukkhakkhandhasutta ",
  "mn13:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "mn13:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā sāvatthiyaṁ viharati jetavane anāthapiṇḍikassa ārāme. ",
  "mn13:2.1": "Atha kho sambahulā bhikkhū pubbaṇhasamayaṁ nivāsetvā pattacīvaramādāya sāvatthiṁ piṇḍāya pāvisiṁsu. ",
  "mn13:2.2": "Atha kho tesaṁ bhikkhūnaṁ etadahosi: ",
  "mn13:2.3": "“atippago kho tāva sāvatthiyaṁ piṇḍāya carituṁ, ",
  "mn13:2.4": "yaṁ nūna mayaṁ yena aññatitthiyānaṁ paribbājakānaṁ ārāmo tenupasaṅkameyyāmā”ti. ",
  "mn13:2.5": "Atha kho te bhikkhū yena aññatitthiyānaṁ paribbājakānaṁ ārāmo tenupasaṅkamiṁsu; upasaṅkamitvā tehi aññatitthiyehi paribbājakehi saddhiṁ sammodiṁsu; ",
  "mn13:2.6": "sammodanīyaṁ kathaṁ sāraṇīyaṁ vītisāretvā ekamantaṁ nisīdiṁsu. Ekamantaṁ nisinne kho te bhikkhū te aññatitthiyā paribbājakā etadavocuṁ: ",
  "mn13:3.1": "“samaṇo, āvuso, gotamo kāmānaṁ pariññaṁ paññapeti, mayampi kāmānaṁ pariññaṁ paññapema; ",
  "mn13:3.2": "samaṇo, āvuso, gotamo rūpānaṁ pariññaṁ paññapeti, mayampi rūpānaṁ pariññaṁ paññapema; ",
  "mn13:3.3": "samaṇo, āvuso, gotamo vedanānaṁ pariññaṁ paññapeti, mayampi vedanānaṁ pariññaṁ paññapema; ",
  "mn13:3.4": "idha no, āvuso, ko viseso, ko adhippayāso, kiṁ nānākaraṇaṁ samaṇassa vā gotamassa amhākaṁ vā—",
  "mn13:3.5": "ya